      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For WCAG 2.1 compliance, you'll want to focus on a few key areas, especially for a fintech app where clarity is crucial.  First, always check your color contrast ratios; aim for at least a 4.5:1 ratio for normal text.  When testing with screen readers, ensure all interactive elements have proper ARIA labels and semantic HTML so the screen reader can announce them correctly.  It's a good idea to test across different screen reader combinations, like JAWS or NVDA.",
